IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg1-s114-nonstock`

-- Tests of section 114 (dg1-s114-nonstock.l4). Every expected value is written by hand from the text
-- (src:195-212), beside the assertion, and was decided before the module was run.

§ `Tests of section 114`

§§ `s 114(a) the reading`

-- a stock corporation reads every reference as written
#ASSERT `s 114(a) how the reference in the provision is read` `a stock corporation` (`s 114 the whole of section` 220) `a reference to stockholders of the corporation` EQUALS `as written`
#ASSERT `s 114(a) how the reference in the provision is read` `a stock corporation` (`s 114 the whole of section` 220) `a reference to stock, capital stock, or shares thereof of a corporation authorized to issue capital stock` EQUALS `as written`
-- a nonstock corporation, in a section the lists do not name (section 220): the four paragraphs
#ASSERT `s 114(a) how the reference in the provision is read` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` (`s 114 the whole of section` 220) `a reference to stockholders of the corporation` EQUALS `as a reference to members of the corporation`
#ASSERT `s 114(a) how the reference in the provision is read` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` (`s 114 the whole of section` 220) `a reference to the board of directors of the corporation` EQUALS `as a reference to the governing body of the corporation`
#ASSERT `s 114(a) how the reference in the provision is read` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` (`s 114 the whole of section` 220) `a reference to directors or to members of the board of directors of the corporation` EQUALS `as a reference to members of the governing body of the corporation`
-- stock is memberships for a nonprofit nonstock corporation, membership interests for any other nonstock corporation
#ASSERT `s 114(a) how the reference in the provision is read` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` (`s 114 the whole of section` 220) `a reference to stock, capital stock, or shares thereof of a corporation authorized to issue capital stock` EQUALS `as a reference to membership interests of a nonstock corporation that is not a nonprofit nonstock corporation`
#ASSERT `s 114(a) how the reference in the provision is read` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` (`s 114 the whole of section` 220) `a reference to stock, capital stock, or shares thereof of a corporation authorized to issue capital stock` EQUALS `as a reference to memberships of a nonprofit nonstock corporation`
#ASSERT `s 114(a) how the reference in the provision is read` `a charitable nonstock corporation` (`s 114 the whole of section` 220) `a reference to stock, capital stock, or shares thereof of a corporation authorized to issue capital stock` EQUALS `as a reference to memberships of a nonprofit nonstock corporation`

