§§ `s 114(c) a nonprofit nonstock corporation`

-- the further provisions of (c)(2) apply only to a nonprofit nonstock corporation
#ASSERT `s 114(b) and (c) subsection (a) does not apply to the provision` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` (`s 114 the whole of section` 217)
#ASSERT `s 114(b) and (c) subsection (a) does not apply to the provision` `a charitable nonstock corporation` (`s 114 the whole of section` 217)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 114(b) and (c) subsection (a) does not apply to the provision` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` (`s 114 the whole of section` 217))
#ASSERT `s 114(b) and (c) subsection (a) does not apply to the provision` `a charitable nonstock corporation` (`s 114 the part` "(b)(3)" `of section` 102)
#ASSERT `s 114(b) and (c) subsection (a) does not apply to the provision` `a charitable nonstock corporation` (`s 114 the part` "(a)(2)" `of section` 111)
#ASSERT `s 114(b) and (c) subsection (a) does not apply to the provision` `a charitable nonstock corporation` (`s 114 the part` "(a)(3)" `of section` 111)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 114(b) and (c) subsection (a) does not apply to the provision` `a charitable nonstock corporation` (`s 114 the part` "(a)(1)" `of section` 111))
#ASSERT `s 114(b) and (c) subsection (a) does not apply to the provision` `a charitable nonstock corporation` (`s 114 the part` "(a)(2)" `of section` 144)
#ASSERT `s 114(b) and (c) subsection (a) does not apply to the provision` `a charitable nonstock corporation` (`s 114 the part` "(a)" `of section` 218)
#ASSERT `s 114(b) and (c) subsection (a) does not apply to the provision` `a charitable nonstock corporation` (`s 114 the part` "(b)" `of section` 218)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 114(b) and (c) subsection (a) does not apply to the provision` `a charitable nonstock corporation` (`s 114 the part` "(c)" `of section` 218))
#ASSERT `s 114(b) and (c) subsection (a) does not apply to the provision` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` (`s 114 the whole of section` 262)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 114(b) and (c) subsection (a) does not apply to the provision` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` (`s 114 the whole of section` 262))
